The trip plan has been constructed based on the given constraints and direct flight connections. The itinerary ensures that:

- Mykonos is visited from Day 1 to Day 3 to cover the wedding event.
- Prague is visited from Day 7 to Day 9 to cover the visit to relatives.
- All stays meet the required durations: Mykonos (3 days), Prague (3 days), Valencia (5 days), Riga (5 days), Zurich (5 days), Bucharest (5 days), Nice (2 days).
- Travel days are included in the stay ranges for both departure and arrival cities, with no separate flight entries.
- Direct flights are used for all transitions: Mykonos to Zurich (Day 3), Zurich to Prague (Day 7), Prague to Valencia (Day 9), Valencia to Bucharest (Day 13), Bucharest to Riga (Day 17), Riga to Nice (Day 21).

